<p>jab daaghe bekasi na sakina uthaa saki<br />
aur dard-e dil na qouf ke maare sunaa saki<br />
khaaye tamaache shimr ke jab tak ke khaa saki<br />
sin kam tha dukh bohat the na bardaasht laa saki</p>

<p>royi to zalimo'n ne jafaa beshumaar ki<br />
aaqir ye jabr dekh ke mout iqtiyaar ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>gar aah ki to shimr pukaara qamoosh ho<br />
aur chup huwi to bepidari ne kaha ke ro<br />
geh shiddat-e atash se pukaari ke paani do<br />
geh yaad karke reh gayi baba ki pyaas ko</p>

<p>soyi jo aansu ponch ke chashm-e pur aab se<br />
hae hae hussain kehke phir uth baithi qaab se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dil me samaa gaya tha jo shimr-e laee'n ka dar<br />
sone me kaanp kaanp ye kehti thi raat bhar<br />
faryaad cheenta hai gohar shimr-e bad guhar<br />
aata hai ibn-e saad chupoo'n jaake mai kidhar</p>

<p>zainab phupi sambhaalo kaleja dhadakta hai<br />
sajjad bhaai dekho ye qooli ghurakta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jab pyaas lagti roke chacha ko pukaarti<br />
dukhte jo kaan shaah-e huda ko pukaarti<br />
aata na jab koi to khuda ko pukaarti<br />
jeene se tang hoke qazaa ko pukaarti</p>

<p>kehti thi ne chacha na imaam-e umam rahe<br />
rulwaane ko adu rahe rone ko ham rahe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chup thi, to chup thi, bolti jo thi dari hui<br />
waa'n shimr aaya tan me idhar thar thari hui<br />
thi aah baat baat ye lab par dhari hui<br />
gardan ki reesmaan lahu me bhari hui</p>

<p>dam rukne lagta tha to rasan khol lete the<br />
baahar jo shimr bolta to baandh lete the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haale shabe wafaat e sakina hai yaadgaar</p>
goya ke apni marg thi bekas pe aashkaar</p>
milti thi shaam se wo gale sab ke baar baar</p>
maa ki balaaye leti thi wo maa ki ghamgusaar</p>

<p>tasleem ko phupi ki kabhi sar jhukaati thi</p>
thi beqata pa sab se qata baqshwaati thi</p>
____________________________<br />

<p>kubra se chup ke chup ke kabhi karti thi bayaa'n</p>
kal ek jaga mai jaaungi is ghar se mehmaaa'n</p>
ro kar wo puchti thi kaho to kaha'n kaha'n</p>
darwaaze me to qufl hai gardan me reesmaa'n</p>

<p>ye kehti thi ke qufl laga hai to kya hua</p>
zindaa'n hai bandh rouza e rizwa'n khula hua</p>
____________________________<br />

<p>zindaa'n se kehti thi ye kabhi wo aseere gham<br />
ho jaayega kal ek tera mehmaan kam<br />
mayyat kisi ki nanhi si niklegi subha dam<br />
bano se ye qitaab kabhi tha ba chasme nam</p>

<p>ek taaza mout hogi nabi ke gharaane me<br />
amma lutogi aaj ki shab qaid qaane me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bano pukaari lut to chuki ab lutogi kya</p>
bibi na naam lutne ka lo tum pe mai fida</p>
gouhar chine tamaache lage kaan shaq hua</p>
lutne se meri bibi ka par dil nahi bhara</p>

<p>zainab ki pusht noke sinaa'n se figaar hai</p>
par meri pyari lutne ki umeed waar hai</p>
____________________________<br />

<p>ab kya lutogi maal nahi zar nahi raha<br />
akbar nahi raha ali asghar nahi raha<br />
rehne ko qaid qaana mila ghar nahi raha<br />
haatho'n me reesma bandhi zewar nahi raha</p>

<p>doulat hai kounsi jise zindaa'n me khoungi<br />
<p>rona tha jisko ro chuki ab kisko roungi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kubra hai aur tum ho ye sajjad e naatawa'n</p>
gar ye bache to naam hai warna hai be nisha'n</p>
wo boli sab rahenge salaamat pa ham kaha'n</p>
maa ne kaha quda na kare aye sakina jaa'n</p>

<p>ki arz dekh logi jo pichli ko hoyega </p>
baba ki rone wali ko sab kunba royega</p>
____________________________<br />

<p>ab mout meri sab ko mubarak kare quda<br />
marte hi mere qaid se sab kunba ho rehaa<br />
jaata rahe buqaar baradar ka bedawaa<br />
jannat ko ham rawaa'n ho'n madine ko aqrobaa</p>

<p>ghul ho sakina leke bala sab ki margayi<br />
hyder ki pothi mushkilen aasan kar gayi<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>